{"t":"NVT","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"nVent Electric plc","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","employees":12000,"hq":"London, United Kingdom","website":"https://www.nvent.com","summary_en":"nVent Electric plc designs, manufactures, markets, installs, and services electrical connection and protection solutions in the America, Europe, the Middle East, India, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and internationally. It operates in two segments, Systems Protection and Electrical Connections. The company provides solutions to protect electronics, systems, and data in mission critical applications, including data centers. It also offers solutions that connect power and data infrastructure. In addition, the company provides bus systems, cable management, control buildings, liquid and air-cooling solutions, electrical connections, enclosures, equipment protection, power connections, and power management solutions, switchgear systems, as well as tools and test instruments. The company markets its products through electrical distributors, retail, contractors, and original equipment manufacturers under the nVent CADDY, ERICO, HOFFMAN, ILSCO, SCHROFF, and TRACHTE brand names. Its products are used for various applications, such as industrial, commercial and residential, infrastructure, and energy. The company was founded in 1903 and is based in London, the United Kingdom.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"nVent Electric plc는 미국, 유럽, 중동, 인도, 아프리카, 아시아 태평양 및 국제적으로 전기 연결 및 보호 솔루션을 설계, 제조, 판매, 설치 및 서비스합니다. 시스템 보호와 전기 연결이라는 두 부분으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 데이터 센터를 포함한 미션 크리티컬 애플리케이션에서 전자 장치, 시스템 및 데이터를 보호하는 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 전력과 데이터 인프라를 연결하는 솔루션도 제공합니다. 또한 이 회사는 버스 시스템, 케이블 관리, 제어 건물, 액체 및 공랭식 솔루션, 전기 연결, 인클로저, 장비 보호, 전원 연결, 전원 관리 솔루션, 스위치기어 시스템, 도구 및 테스트 장비를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 nVent CADDY, ERICO, HOFFMAN, ILSCO, SCHROFF 및 TRACHTE 브랜드 이름으로 전기 유통업체, 소매업체, 계약업체 및 OEM을 통해 제품을 판매합니다. 해당 제품은 산업, 상업, 주거, ​​인프라, 에너지 등 다양한 응용 분야에 사용됩니다. 이 회사는 1903년에 설립되었으며 영국 런던에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":111.92,"mcap":18086055936.0,"pe":24.7064,"fpe":15.916356,"peg":0.5313,"ps":3.41575,"pb":4.397815,"ev_ebitda":16.574,"div":0.82,"beta":1.381,"hi52":184.64,"lo52":93.22},"fin":{"rev":5294900224.0,"rev_g":0.437,"eps_g":0.654,"gross":0.36174,"op":0.17708999,"net":0.12833,"roe":0.17423001,"fcf":503687488.0,"cash":1121799936.0,"debt":2345900032.0,"de":57.043,"eps":4.53,"feps":7.03176},"own":{"short":0.0401,"inst":0.98070997,"insider":0.0080699995},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":197.11111,"median":200.0,"high":233.0,"low":139.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.25,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":16,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":16,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":15,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":15,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-11","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":155.0,"priorPriceTarget":167.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Roth Capital","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":200.0,"priorPriceTarget":200.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":200.0,"priorPriceTarget":228.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":190.0,"priorPriceTarget":182.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":208.0,"priorPriceTarget":200.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","current